  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Question tags**",
      "",
      "Una pregunta corta al final de una frase para pedir confirmación.",
      "",
      "**Regla básica: opuesto**",
      "",
      "| Frase | Tag | Ejemplo |",
      "|---|---|---|",
      "| afirmativa | tag **negativo** | *It's lovely, **isn't it**?* |",
      "| negativa | tag **positivo** | *You haven't been, **have you**?* |",
      "",
      "**Auxiliar según el tiempo**",
      "",
      "| Frase | Tag |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| *You are* | *aren't you?* |",
      "| *You like* (presente simple) | *don't you?* |",
      "| *He likes* | *doesn't he?* |",
      "| *They went* (pasado simple) | *didn't they?* |",
      "| *You have been* | *haven't you?* |",
      "| *She can swim* | *can't she?* |",
      "| *It will rain* | *won't it?* |",
      "",
      "**Casos especiales**",
      "",
      "- *I am* → *aren't I?* (no *amn't I*): *I'm late, aren't I?*",
      "- *Let's …* → *shall we?*: *Let's go, shall we?*",
      "- *Imperativo* → *will you? / won't you?*: *Open the door, will you?*",
      "- *Nobody / Somebody* → *they*: *Nobody called, did they?*",
      "- *There is* → *isn't there?*: *There's a bank near here, isn't there?*",
      "",
      "**Entonación**",
      "",
      "- **Sube** ↗ = pregunta de verdad (no estás seguro): *You're from Madrid, aren't you?* ↗",
      "- **Baja** ↘ = buscas confirmación o conversación: *Lovely day, isn't it?* ↘",
      "",
      "**Respuestas:** *Yes, it is. · No, it isn't. · Yes, I do. · No, I haven't.* Respondes a la realidad, no al tag.",
      "",
      "**Ojo:** ✘ *It's a nice day, no?* (no existe *no?*) · ✘ *You like it, don't it?* (el auxiliar debe coincidir con el sujeto).",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *isn't* /ˈɪznt/ · *aren't* /ɑːnt/ · *shall* /ʃæl/."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "It's nice, no?",
        "right": "It's nice, isn't it?",
        "note": "Tag con auxiliar."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "She likes it, don't she?",
        "right": "She likes it, doesn't she?",
        "note": "Auxiliar con el sujeto."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
